[Desktop Entry]
# Chess (kawa-chess), as Super+U's learning tab opens it: the year's plan, lessons, puzzles, games against Stockfish and a
# review of each, in a terminal window of its own. Its icon: our knight (the launcher draws it: X-Fedokawaii-Icon).
Type=Application
Name=Chess
GenericName=Chess course
Comment=From the first move to 1800: a game a sitting, lessons, puzzles, a review of every game
X-Fedokawaii-Icon=knight
Exec=@HOME@/.local/bin/kawa-chess --window
Terminal=false
Categories=Game;BoardGame;Education;
Keywords=chess;stockfish;puzzles;tactics;lessons;learning;openings;endgames;
